OMAT-SE

Faceted search over materials composition and property measurements.
Status: phase 0 — search UI on mock data.

Repository
  apps/api       FastAPI service
  apps/mcp       MCP server (Python SDK)
  apps/web       Next.js UI, deployed on Vercel
  apps/workers   Async consumers (phase 2)
  packages/      Shared Python domain, ingestion CLI, generated TypeScript client
  data/          Source CSVs, taxonomy, index mappings
  infra/         Docker and Terraform
  docs/          Architecture, schema, ADRs, API reference
  report/        LaTeX write-up

Local setup
  cp .env.example .env
  cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env.local
  just up
  just install
  just dev-api
  bun install
  just web-dev
  just docs      # local API reference on http://localhost:8080

Requirements: Python 3.11+, Bun, Docker.
Architecture: docs/architecture.md
Schema: docs/schema.md
API reference: docs/api/index.html (published to GitHub Pages)
License: MIT
